## Decision Record

| Type | Record |
|---|---|
| Evidence | [Files, tests, ADRs, logs, or issue evidence inspected.] |
| Decisions | [Chosen approach and why it fits the current project.] |
| Assumptions | [Only assumptions needed for the task, with validation plan.] |
| Open questions | [Questions that could change a material decision.] |
| Validation status | [Completed, pending, and unavailable checks.] |
| Next action | [Smallest next action or handoff.] |

> Do not use a numerical confidence score as a decision gate. Ask focused questions only when an unresolved answer could change architecture, security, data, API contracts, dependencies, or user-visible behavior.

